                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Simple game where you have to change the music to keep the club happy.\n\nOne of those very original games with a very unique concept.\n\nYou are a DJ in a Club, and you change the music to keep you patrons happy and spending money.\n\nThe game mechanics are pretty easy to get, you can play each song once, and you have to play a new disk before the old one ends, you can only play and pause the songs, no rewind, no forward, no repeating it.\n\nI dont think i found 2 songs that would \"fit\" together so you could do a \"proper\" mix, each time a Night is finished you can buy more songs or some upgrades, all in all its as far as i know a one of a kind game.\n\nThe game is free and it has its charm, so i recommend it to anyone that wants to hear some nice tunes",
